 style="color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 6px; font-size: 
 13px;">[3] Atomic Context: Visual Resource Highlighting</h4><p style=
 "font-size: 11px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Complete visua
 l context awareness. Files loaded into the active AI context automati
 cally light up with a vibrant indicator directly inside the NetBeans 
 Projects, Files, and Favorites views.</p><a href="https://asi.anahata
