  solid #e2e8f0;"><h4 style="color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bot
 tom: 6px; font-size: 13px;">[4] Real-Time 3D & Hardware Prototyping (
 LWJGL)</h4><p style="font-size: 11px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 10p
 x 0;">With built-in LWJGL, GLFW, and OpenGL dependencies, the agent c
 an write, compile, and run raw, real-time 3D rendering windows and ga
