 0;"><h4 style="color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 6px; fon
 t-size: 13px;">[7] Project Structure & Class Hierarchy Mapping</h4><p
  style="font-size: 11px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">The mod
 el receives structured directory trees of all open source packages, m
 apping classes, interfaces, records, field modifiers, and precise siz
 es without expensive directory walking.</p><a href="https://asi.anaha
 ta.uno/screenshots/netbeans/ProjectStructureContextProvider.png" targ
 et="_blank"><img src="https://asi.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/th
 umbs/ProjectStructureContextProvider.png" alt="[7] Project Structure 
 & Class Hierarchy Mapping" width="650" border="0" /></a></div><div st
 yle="margin-bottom: 20px; padding: 12px; background: #fff; border: 1p
 x solid #e2e8f0;"><h4 style="color: #004d98; margin-top: 0; margin-bo
 ttom: 6px; font-size: 13px;">[8] Instant Diagnostics & Javac Errors C
 ache</h4><p style="font-size: 11px; color: #4a5568; margin: 0 0 10px 
 0;">Continuous, turn-by-turn tracking of workspace health. If a code 
 patch triggers a compilation error, the agent instantly receives the 
 full compiler error stack trace during reloop.</p><a href="https://as
 i.anahata.uno/screenshots/netbeans/ProjectAlertsContextProvider.png" 
